<title>USA: Riverview Savings raises dividend.</title>
<headline>Riverview Savings raises dividend.</headline>
<dateline>CAMAS, Wash. 1997-03-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Riverview Savings Bank said it increased its quarterly dividend to $0.06 per share of common stock, from $0.055.</p>
<p>The new dividend is payable April 11 to shareholders of record March 31.</p>
</text>
